          <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base">
            Transparent metrics. Pass Phase 1 (12%) and Phase 2 (8%), verify your KYC, and start trading funded institutional accounts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- MODEL TOGGLE -->
