                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Phase 1 Target</span><strong class="text-white">12% ($600)</strong></li>
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Phase 2 Target</span><strong class="text-white">8% ($400)</strong></li>
