              <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-xs text-gray-300 border-t border-white/10 pt-4">
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Phase 1 Target</span><strong class="text-white">12% ($1,200)</strong></li>
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Phase 2 Target</span><strong class="text-white">8% ($800)</strong></li>
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Max Daily Loss</span><strong class="text-white">4% ($400)</strong></li>
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Max Total Loss</span><strong class="text-white">8% ($800)</strong></li>
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Min Trading Days</span><strong class="text-white">3 Days</strong></li>
                <li class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>Profit Split</span><strong class="text-emerald-400">90%</strong></li>
