        <div class="space-y-4" id="faq-container">
          <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-white">
              <span>What are the profit targets for the 2-Phase evaluation?</span>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition-transform"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed hidden">
              Phase 1 target is 12%, and Phase 2 target is 8%. You must trade a minimum of 3 separate trading days on each phase before progressing.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-white">
              <span>What are the maximum drawdown limitations?</span>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition-transform"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed hidden">
              The Maximum Daily Loss is 4% (based on the balance or equity at 00:00 UTC, whichever is higher). The overall Maximum Loss is 8% of the initial account balance.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-white">
              <span>How do I receive my cTrader credentials after payment?</span>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition-transform"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed hidden">
              Credentials are generated instantly! Once your crypto transaction is confirmed on the blockchain, your login, password, and server IP are displayed on your screen and emailed to your registered address.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-glass p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 cursor-pointer" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-white">
              <span>Is news trading and weekend holding allowed?</span>
              <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 transition-transform"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed hidden">
              Yes! Traders are permitted to hold swing trades over the weekend and execute during major news releases without penalty. High-frequency arbitrage and latency abuse are prohibited.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

